{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》尚未推出PC版，民間移植團隊已經開始搶跑。不過，這場由黑客泄露引發的PC移植行動，如今似乎遭遇了意外變故。此前，黑客組織CyberLeek聲稱已經泄露《GTA6》Xbox版本的完整遊戲文件，總容量高達209GB，其中不僅包含Rockstar自研的RAGE遊戲引擎相關文件，還包括最關鍵的遊戲EXE可執行程序。隨後，該組織又發佈了一個57MB的壓縮包，據稱能夠補全相關文件，為社區重新編譯遊戲提供必要條件。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587790.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T04:03:54.541582+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T03:41:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.332982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:57:16.332982+00:00","content_hash":"89a6791e451639c91776d6c7c7c09b00593bff52a3a086c2ca26813de945ee40","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}